### reference.list_branches
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reference/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### reference.list_courses
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reference/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### reference.list_roles
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reference/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### reference.list_staff
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reference/staff
